{%- comment -%}
  PM — Mega menu data
  Static category map used as a fallback when the Shopify "main-menu"
  linklist has no nested children. Mirrors the Hydrogen storefront's
  app/data/megaMenu.ts groupings 1:1.

  Output:
    Sets `_static_children`  → comma-separated "Title:handle" pairs
    Sets `_show_brands`      → true | false
    Sets `_card_columns_xl`  → 3 (default), 2 for software-style cards
  Usage from caller:
    {%- assign _parent_handle = link.handle -%}
    {%- render 'pm-mega-data', parent: _parent_handle -%}
  But because Liquid snippets don't return values to the caller scope,
  this file is actually *included* inline below via `{% include %}` so
  variables hoist.  Kept here purely for documentation/reference.
{%- endcomment -%}
